{"translation":{"id":"gaz_ebi","name":"ክታበ ቁልቁሉ, Biblica® ሂካ አመያ በነማ ሃራ, ሎቆደ ዽኣ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=gaze","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=gaze","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"EBI","englishName":"West Central Oromo Bible","language":"gaz","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"f3eeb22163e62abd4aeeda7f1c58a68dfa1fff2482db437ee160fb95280d59e5","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31102,"languageName":"Oromoo","languageEnglishName":"Oromo"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"gaz_ebi","name":"ሆሴኣ","commonName":"ሆሴኣ","title":"ራጂ ሆሴኣ","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"72244536d9404b992eb62b15971a2e27bbd0b4642b4487007f0eedf6754ab5ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ሆሴኣን ኒቲ ኦፊት አራረሜ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["ዋቀዮ አከነ ናን ጄዼ፤ “ነምን ብራ እሼ ጃለቴ እሼን ሰጋገልቱ ታቱዩ፣ አት ዸቂቲ አመስ ኒቲኬት ጃለለኬ አርግሲስ። አኩመ ዋቀዮ ኡቱመ እሳን ዋቆተ ብራት ዴብአኒ ብጥሌ ወይኒ ጃለተኑ እስራኤሎተ ጃለቴ ሰነ አትስ እሼ ጃለዹ።”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["ከናፉ አን ሜቲ ሰቅሊ ኩዸ ሸኒን፣ ገርቡ ሆሜሪ ቶኮፊ ወለካቲን እሼ ነንብተዼ።"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["አን ኤርገሲ አከነ ነንጄዼን፤ “አት በረ ሄዱ ነ ወጅን ጅራቹ ቀብደ፤ አት ሰጋገልቱ ተኡ ዮካን ነመ ከምዩ ወጅን ቶኮ ተኡ ህንቀብዱ፤ አን ስ ወጅን ነንጅራዸ።”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["እስራኤሎትን ሞቲ ዮካን እልመ ሞቲ መሌ፣ ኣርሳ ዮካን ኡቱባ ዋቄፈትና መሌ ድረተ ዮካን ዋቆተ ቶልፈሞ መሌ በረ ባይኤ ንጅራቱቲ።"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["ኤርገሲሞ እስራኤሎትን ዴብአኒ ዋቀዮ ዋቀሳኒቲፊ ዳዊት ሞቲሳኒ በርባዱ። እሳን በረ ዹማ ኬሰ ሆለቻ ገረ ዋቀዮቲፊ ገረ ኤበሳ ንዹፉ።"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/HOS/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/HOS/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/HOS/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}